        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2016 Pakistan Super League, opening ceremony, first match\n- Places: Dubai International Cricket Stadium, Dubai, United Arab Emirates\n- Products: \"Ab Khel Ke Dikha\"\n- Concepts: official anthem\n\nFacts:\n- On 4 February 2016, the opening ceremony and first match of the 2016 Pakistan Super League were held at the Dubai International Cricket Stadium.\n- The 2016 Pakistan Super League was the first season of the Pakistan Super League.\n- \"Ab Khel Ke Dikha\" was the official anthem of the 2016 Pakistan Super League.\n- Dubai International Cricket Stadium is a multi-purpose stadium in Dubai, United Arab Emirates.\n- Dubai International Cricket Stadium was formerly known as the Dubai Sports City Cricket Stadium.",
